hat Would Change My Mind&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px;color:#56657A"&gt;the missing evidence, named&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF6D5;strokeColor=#D69E00;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2330;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="aws"><mxGeometry x="4" y="182" width="208" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sys_118" value='&lt;b&gt;8. One-Click Undo&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px;color:#56657A"&gt;compensating action, pre-built&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E8771A;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2330;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="aws"><mxGeometry x="224" y="182" width="208" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sys_119" value='&lt;b&gt;9. Customer Reply Draft&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px;color:#56657A"&gt;edit before it is sent&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=12;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#E8771A;strokeWidth=1.2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1B2330;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=4;" vertex="1" parent="aws"><mxGeometry x="444" y="182" width="208" height="62" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sys_120" value='&lt;b&gt;10. Decide — Approve · Edit · Reject&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style="font-size:9px;color:#56657A"&gt;the decision is sealed to the exact state it was made on; it also becomes a training label&lt;/span&gt;' style="rounded=1;arcSize=30;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FDE2EC;strokeColor=none;fontSize=11;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#1B2330;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontStyle=0;strokeColor=#E05A8A;" vertex="1" parent="aws"><mxGeometry x="14" y="258" width="636" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="sys_121" value='&lt;b&gt;Escalation packet anatomy&lt;/b&gt;&lt;ul style="margin:3px 0 0 0;padding-left:15px;font-size:9px;line-height:1.35"&g